    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Card presents information in a contained surface. It supports headers, extra actions, cover media, metadata, grid sections, tabs, loading placeholders, hover feedback, and borderless presentation.</source>
        <target state="translated">Card 用于在独立的内容面板中呈现信息，支持标题、额外操作、封面媒体、元信息、栅格区域、标签页、加载占位、悬停反馈和无边框样式。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
